y handles symbols like ! @ # by pressing Shift for you.\n\nFormat King: Reads standard [abc], advanced {abc}, and complex (abc) sheets perfectly.\n\n4. Performance UI\n\nBold Editor: Big text area using GothamBold so you can actually see the sheet while it's playing.\n\nTween Minimize: Smooth animation that tucks the menu away into a tiny bar.\n\nRightShift: Quick toggle to hide or show the whole thing.\n\nShould I add a search bar to the library so it's easier to find songs once you save a bunch?","tags":["Autoplayer","Piano","Piano autoplayer"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6890c11a437b179568cbc688","username":"qanona00","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"6890c11a437b179568cbc688","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T17:31:55.504Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6973fd037b4426d379d602d9","editBy":{"_id":"6890c11a437b179568cbc688","username":"qanona00","status":"offline","id":"6890c11a437b179568cbc688"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-01-23T22:58:11.809Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"697402537b4426d379d65ae0","commentBy":{"_id":"696c3f79ce7e338b9df18254","username":"slimeydude107","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b70dd7769845d869428c9c00b47c8bb8da044bf8d55fe3b0009244b15115bb29.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/696c3f79ce7e338b9df18254-1768701879497.png"},"lastActive":"2026-01-27T02:45:44.499Z","createdAt":"2026-01-18T02:03:37.764Z","status":"offline","id":"696c3f79ce7e338b9df18254","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b70dd7769845d869428c9c00b47c8bb8